    <briefdescription>
<para>Legacy <computeroutput><ref refid="class_ints_set" kindref="compound">IntsSet</ref></computeroutput> configuration that bundles hashing, equality, and a <computeroutput><ref refid="class_module_monom_default_config_orig_ac16b354d5be5b1a20248a75c7c2cce83_1ac16b354d5be5b1a20248a75c7c2cce83" kindref="member">display</ref></computeroutput> helper into one functor object. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides the older single-functor shape (<computeroutput>operator()(m)</computeroutput> for hash, <computeroutput>operator()(a, b)</computeroutput> for equality), with <computeroutput><ref refid="class_module_monom_default_config_orig_a8fe94b3177b7b214c72b27fff2ae54af_1a8fe94b3177b7b214c72b27fff2ae54af" kindref="member">keysEqual</ref></computeroutput> doing a length-prefixed elementwise check that ignores the slot reserved for <computeroutput>value</computeroutput>. Superseded by <computeroutput><ref refid="class_module_monom_default_config" kindref="compound">ModuleMonomDefaultConfig</ref></computeroutput>, which moved <computeroutput>Hash</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>Eq</computeroutput> into discrete member functors. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
